Read and obey /AGENTS.md before any change. The repository holds documentation only until M1 builds the code. Take a task id from docs/PROGRESS.md; work on a branch feat/<task-id>-<slug>; never commit to main; no coding task starts before docs/03-ARCHITECTURE.md is confirmed. Rate limits are accounted per public egress IP with constants from config/venues.yaml; every network function gets an offline fixture test; no secrets in the repo; user-visible text describes state and never advises.
